<title>POLAND: Agros trades on kerb at PLN 80.</title>
<headline>Agros trades on kerb at PLN 80.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 32,913 shares in Agros was struck at 80 zlotys on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the regular session, Agros traded at 82 zlotys in a 6,000-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
